      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Oakdale Township organized in 1858, later merging with Northdale in the 1970s to form the city that still annexed land into the 1990s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
